        197.79885864257812,
        97.4629898071289
      ],
      "text": "5.\t  Record information",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        105.08648681640625,
        513.37158203125,
        118.43798828125
      ],
      "text": "Record all the information required by your institution for documentation (e.g. date",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        108.75839233398438,
        91.36740112304688,
        116.75839233398438
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        121.0830078125,
        498.9045715332031,
        134.43450927734375
      ],
      "text": "and time of test administration, injection site location, lot number of tuberculin).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        147.51138305664062,
        159.94290161132812,
        507.5353698730469,
        174.16290283203125
      ],
      "text": "Administration of the tuberculin skin test using the Mantoux",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        160.23089599609375,
        147.51138305664062,
        174.16290283203125
      ],
      "text": "Figure A3.1",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        157.03939819335938,
        174.34292602539062,
        201.04339599609375,
        188.56292724609375
      ],
      "text": "method",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        479.3000183105469,
        138.7154083251953,
        495.8900146484375
      ],
      "text": "Reading",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Bold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        509.91351318359375,
        513.4951171875,
        523.2650146484375
      ],
      "text": "The results should be read between 48 and 72 hours after administration. A patient",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        525.9099731445312,
        513.4605712890625,
        539.261474609375
      ],
      "text": "who does not return within 72 hours will probably need to be rescheduled for another",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        541.906494140625,
        104.20989990234375,
        555.2579956054688
      ],
      "text": "TST.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        562.4454956054688,
        157.19039916992188,
        577.06201171875
      ],
      "text": "1.\t  Inspect site",
      "font": "Calibri",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        585.0674438476562,
        513.4176025390625,
        598.4189453125
      ],
      "text": "Visually inspect injection site under good light, and measure induration (thickening",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        588.7393188476562,
        91.36740112304688,
        596.7393188476562
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        601.0639038085938,
        349.42755126953125,
        614.4154052734375
      ],
      "text": "of the skin), not erythema (reddening of the skin).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04360961914062,
        619.8718872070312,
        194.34036254882812,
        635.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "2.\t  Palpate induration",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        643.4674072265625,
        320.2520446777344,
        656.8189086914062
      ],
      "text": "Use fingertips to find margins of induration.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        647.1392822265625,
        91.36740112304688,
        655.1392822265625
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        662.2719116210938,
        187.5673828125,
        678.2439575195312
      ],
      "text": "3.\t  Mark induration",
      "font": "ArialMT",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        685.867431640625,
        510.24365234375,
        699.2189331054688
      ],
      "text": "Use fingertips as a guide for marking widest edges of induration across the forearm.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        689.539306640625,
        91.36740112304688,
        697.539306640625
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.04249572753906,
        707.33935546875,
        400.9098815917969,
        721.3439331054688
      ],
      "text": "Measure diameter of induration using a clear flexible ruler 4.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-LightItali",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        729.867431640625,
        414.172607421875,
        743.2189331054688
      ],
      "text": "Place “0” of ruler line on the inside left edge of the induration.",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        733.539306640625,
        91.36740112304688,
        741.539306640625
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        751.867431640625,
        513.4521484375,
        765.2189331054688
      ],
      "text": "Read ruler line on the inside right edge of the induration (use lower measurement if",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        755.539306640625,
        91.36740112304688,
        763.539306640625
      ],
      "text": "l",
      "font": "ZapfDingbatsITC",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        104.87999725341797,
        767.8638916015625,
        296.5849609375,
        781.2153930664062
      ],
      "text": "between two gradations on mm scale).",
      "font": "FrutigerLTStd-Light",
      "size": 11.5,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        8.642800331115723,
        805.8439331054688,
        42.002803802490234,
        835.8439331054688
      ],
      "text": "116",
      "font": "HelveticaNeue-Light",
      "size": 20.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    }
  ]
